/* Tailscreen — Swedish (sv) localization.
 *
 * Keys are identical to en.lproj/Localizable.strings (the English source
 * text). Only the values are translated. Format specifiers (%@, %lld),
 * key-equivalent glyphs (⌘Q), and brand names ("Tailscreen", "Tailscale")
 * are preserved.
 *
 * Serves all three apps. A key missing from this file is not an error — the
 * lookup falls back to the key, which is the English text — so a partially
 * translated catalog degrades string by string rather than all at once.
 */

